    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TIMETABLE EFFECTIVE AUGUST 1st, 1950\nBCPA\nDC-6 Sleeper Service\nCANADA-USA-HAWAII-FIJI\nAUSTRALIA - NEW ZEALAND\nBritish Commonwealth\nPacific Airlines Ltd\n1 nrevious lists canceller",
